 "title": "SS8050 NPN 25 V, 1.5 A transistor in SOT-23",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev. - 2.1",
  "pages": 4
 },
 "summary": "SS8050 is a single NPN bipolar transistor in a three-lead SOT-23 surface-mount package. It stands off 25 V collector to emitter, carries up to 1.5 A of collector current and may dissipate 300 mW at 25 ℃ ambient. Its PNP partner is SS8550. hFE(1), measured at VCE = 1 V and IC = 100 mA, is sold in three ranks, L (120-200), H (200-350) and J (300-400); the 200-350 range is rank H. The package is marked Y1.",
